                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>05</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>未解问题：两个根本缺口与切入机会</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>指标不可比 · 全链路无实测 → 五个挑战与五个博士生切入方向</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>低空经济场景下的通感一体化（ISAC）· 文献调研</Text>
